# Do not delete unacknowledged local mutations

## Affected sites
- `client/components/settings/sync/SyncSettings.svelte:59-63` checks the previously published pending count before runtime teardown.
- `client/stores/datafn.store.ts:691` drains debounced mutations while destroying the storage-backed runtime.
- `client/stores/datafn.store.ts:937-942` catches flush failures and permits teardown to continue.
- `client/stores/datafn.store.ts:670-672` deletes the clone after switching to `sync-direct` without confirming remote acknowledgement.

## Required outcome
- Delete the retired clone only after all debounced and persisted mutations are confirmed synchronized remotely.
- Preserve the clone and restore a consistent runtime/preference state when synchronization or deletion cannot complete.
