# Preserve Nucleum offline startup

## Affected sites
- `client/layout/layers/AuthGuard.svelte:84-89` — redirects all Nucleum cached-cloud sessions to access denied.
- `client/components/account/auth.ts:213-222,305-309` — defines cached-cloud as the usable fallback for stored cloud identities with offlinability enabled.
- `client/components/account/auth.test.ts:123-129` — verifies that the offline cached-cloud session remains valid.

## Required outcome
- A previously authenticated Nucleum subscriber with an offline-capable local clone must be able to start offline or during a retryable AuthFn outage.
- Entitlement enforcement must still reject known non-Nucleum plans without treating temporary inability to revalidate as a definitive access denial.
