# Keep optimistic user preferences account-scoped

## Affected sites
- `client/components/settings/userPreferences.store.ts:78` — stores pending entries in one process-global map.
- `client/components/settings/userPreferences.store.ts:109-115` — reapplies every unmatched pending entry after any namespace's signal update.
- `client/components/settings/userPreferences.store.ts:138-142` — derives a persisted nested value from the potentially overlaid store.
- `client/stores/account.store.ts:233` — destroys DataFn on sign-out without resetting this pending state.

## Required outcome
- Pending user-preference entries must never be applied outside the DataFn namespace that created them.
- Preserve per-mutation rollback behavior and cover a namespace switch while a preference write remains unacknowledged.
