For migrated Pointron or Nucleum users with records in the legacy `tz` store, this map has no timezone target, so `resolveLegacyStoreResource("tz")` returns undefined and recovery silently skips the history even though detection recognizes `tz` as a legacy resource store. The replacement timezone store reads only `datafn.temporal.listTimezoneChanges()`, leaving historical timezone corrections unavailable and causing analytics around earlier timezone changes to be grouped incorrectly after upgrade.

