# Keep E2EE authorities consistent when disable rollback fails

## Affected sites
- `client/stores/datafn.store.ts:861-871` — commits disabled remote metadata, then restores runtime/local E2EE before confirming remote restoration.
- `client/stores/datafn.store.ts:504-511` — treats online remote settings as authoritative and configures no provider when they are disabled.

## Required outcome
- A failed disable must not leave remote metadata disabled while the local database and active runtime remain encrypted.
- If remote compensation cannot complete, retain an explicit recoverable state that prevents normal initialization or writes under mismatched settings.
