In an embedded iOS/macOS recovery flow, `downloadLegacyLocalBackup()` starts the asynchronous `fileStore.downloadFromBlob()` upload/handoff without awaiting or validating it, and this branch immediately saves `download_backup_continue`. If the upload fails or returns no URL, the UI still reports success and permanently suppresses the startup recovery prompt even though the user received no backup; make the helper report delivery success and await it before saving the decision.

